  DEPRECATED — this template is no longer used for anything, and nothing reads it.

  /llms.txt is served directly by templates/llms.txt.liquid, and /llms-full.txt
  by templates/llms-full.txt.liquid. Both were confirmed live on 2026-11-09:
  each root path returns the theme's own Markdown document.

  An earlier version of this file asserted that Shopify cannot serve a custom
  root text file from a theme, and routed /llms.txt through a page plus a URL
  redirect instead. That assertion was wrong. The redirect has since been
  deleted and the /pages/llms page unpublished.

  This file is kept only because theme file deletion is blocked through the
  Admin API. Delete it from the theme code editor in Shopify admin when
  convenient. Do not add content here — edit templates/llms.txt.liquid instead.
